{"id": "70490", "title": "重生之我只做你的明星", "author": "木采", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70490/70490s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70490.htm", "intro": "二十七岁的李凌普在一次事故后醒来，发现自己重生到了一个二十岁的美貌少年身上，而少年是娱乐圈人，也是欧家大少爷欧盛霆的情人。\r\n    欧家是海城第一大世家，欧盛霆本来并不喜欢少年，觉得少年虽然貌美，但心计太重，太会算计，他把少年带在身边，是有别的目的。但少年在一次事故后“失忆”，而失忆后的少年，性格竟然大变——变得那么纯净、温顺……他渐渐就被吸引住。只是当他喜欢上少年后，却发现这个少年并不是原来那个……", "base": "files/article/html/70/70490", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "醒来", "file": "10982356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "初见", "file": "10982357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暧昧还是试探？（一）", "file": "10982358.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暧昧还是试探？（二）", "file": "10982359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "这个儒雅的男人", "file": "10982360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二次相见", "file": "10982361.html", "available": false}, {"title": "好友来访", "file": "10982362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "传说中的娱乐圈（一）", "file": "10982363.html", "available": false}, {"title": "传说中的娱乐圈（二）", "file": "10982364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刘三爷", "file": "10982365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "故地重游", "file": "10982366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "怀疑", "file": "10982367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "唐家大少", "file": "10982368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "温柔是错觉", "file": "10982369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "所谓真相", "file": "10982370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "真相与“情敌”", "file": "10982371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "餍足", "file": "10982372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "义气和请帖", "file": "10982373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "海城三巨头", "file": "10982374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "剧本", "file": "10982375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "数字“27”", "file": "10982376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "劫持", "file": "10982377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谁是你的情人", "file": "10982378.html", "a